> On Tue, Jun 14, 2022 at 01:41:13PM +0100, Mark Rutland wrote:
> > On Wed, Jun 08, 2022 at 04:27:37PM +0200, Peter Zijlstra wrote:
> > > --- a/kernel/time/tick-broadcast.c
